OL,5,G0115 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,6,     FBea realises Toni is dealing drugs
OL,7,     Fand hits Doreen for going along
OL,8,     Fwith her. Karen's childish
OL,9,     Fbehaviour earns her a telling off
OL,10,     Ffrom a furious Angela, and Mum
OL,11,     Fcollapses at home alone.
OL,12,G0215 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,13,     FErica continues her plans to leave
OL,14,     FWentworth, and Jim Fletcher
OL,15,     Freturns to take over as acting
OL,16,     Fgovernor. Toni gets a visit from
OL,17,     FRos Coulson, daughter of the woman
OL,18,     Fshe killed.
